---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';

const dossiers = [
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0047',
    industry:  'Marketing Agency',
    adSpend:   '$38K / mo',
    score:     23,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '6.4s',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ABSENT', flag: true  },
      { label: 'Lead Response',  value: '14h avg',flag: true  },
      { label: 'CTA Visibility', value: 'POOR',  flag: true  },
    ],
    critique: `Homepage hero contained three competing calls-to-action with no visual hierarchy. The primary booking CTA was placed below the fold in a low-contrast grey on grey composition — effectively invisible to 78% of mobile users. Meta Pixel absent entirely, meaning $38K in monthly ad spend was operating with zero attribution data. Every retargeting dollar was evaporating into an untracked void. Page loaded at 6.4 seconds, shedding 23.8% of conversions before a single element rendered. The operator had no visibility into any of this.`,
  },
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0061',
    industry:  'SaaS / Software',
    adSpend:   '$22K / mo',
    score:     31,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '4.9s',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ACTIVE', flag: false },
      { label: 'HubSpot CRM',    value: 'ABSENT', flag: true  },
      { label: 'Form Fields',    value: '11 fields', flag: true },
    ],
    critique: `Pixel was live but firing on incorrect events — purchase tracking was mapped to the contact form submission, poisoning the entire lookalike audience with unqualified cold traffic. Lead intake form demanded 11 fields including company revenue and employee count before the prospect had any context on value proposition. Conversion architecture was built to filter, not to capture. Trial signup flow contained four redirects with no progress indicator, producing a 91% abandonment rate between click and account creation.`,
  },
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0078',
    industry:  'E-commerce / DTC',
    adSpend:   '$61K / mo',
    score:     18,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '8.1s',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ACTIVE', flag: false },
      { label: 'Cart Abandon',   value: '84%',   flag: true  },
      { label: 'Email Capture',  value: 'NONE',  flag: true  },
    ],
    critique: `Eight-second load time on the primary landing page is a revenue cremation event at $61K monthly ad spend — approximately $31K per month evaporating before a product image renders. No email capture mechanism on the site whatsoever, meaning every bounced visitor was permanently lost with zero retargeting path outside paid channels. Cart abandonment at 84% with no automated recovery sequence in place. The operator was running the paid acquisition engine at full throttle with the retention infrastructure completely absent.`,
  },
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0093',
    industry:  'Real Estate',
    adSpend:   '$15K / mo',
    score:     27,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '3.8s',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ABSENT', flag: true  },
      { label: 'Lead Response',  value: '26h avg',flag: true  },
      { label: 'Mobile UX',      value: 'BROKEN', flag: true  },
    ],
    critique: `Lead response time averaged 26 hours — in a market where the first agent to respond wins the client 78% of the time. Mobile layout was non-functional: contact form extended beyond viewport width, rendering the submit button unreachable on any device smaller than a tablet. No Pixel deployed despite running Facebook lead generation campaigns. The operator had built an acquisition funnel with a structural hole at every stage of the journey. Leads were arriving, finding no functional path to conversion, and leaving permanently.`,
  },
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0104',
    industry:  'Coaching / Consulting',
    adSpend:   '$9K / mo',
    score:     35,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '2.9s',  flag: false },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ACTIVE', flag: false },
      { label: 'VSL Completion', value: '11%',   flag: true  },
      { label: 'Book Rate',      value: '2.1%',  flag: true  },
    ],
    critique: `Technical infrastructure was the strongest of this cohort — pixel firing correctly, page speed within threshold. The failure was architectural. VSL completion rate of 11% indicates the hook failed within the first 90 seconds, meaning 89% of paid traffic never reached the offer. Application form positioned immediately after a 41-minute video, creating a commitment asymmetry that destroyed conversion. The booking mechanism used a generic Calendly embed with no pre-qualification framing, producing a 2.1% close rate on calls that were fundamentally unqualified from intake.`,
  },
  {
    serial:    'LS-RCS-0119',
    industry:  'High-Ticket B2B',
    adSpend:   '$47K / mo',
    score:     14,
    metrics: [
      { label: 'Page Load',      value: '7.3s',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Meta Pixel',     value: 'ABSENT', flag: true  },
      { label: 'CRM Integration',value: 'NONE',  flag: true  },
      { label: 'Follow-up Seq.', value: 'MANUAL',flag: true  },
    ],
    critique: `No CRM. No automation. No Pixel. $47K per month flowing into a paid acquisition engine with manual follow-up as the only retention mechanism. Leads were being logged in a spreadsheet and contacted when an account manager had availability — sometimes three to five days post-inquiry. By that window, the prospect had converted with a competitor or disengaged entirely. Page load at 7.3 seconds on a $47K monthly budget represents approximately $24K in monthly conversion losses before the first human interaction ever occurred. This operation was built entirely around hope as a strategy.`,
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Revenue Ledger — Leverage Systems"
  description="Reverse case studies documenting systemic revenue failures in high-spend operators before infrastructure intervention."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main style="background: #0b0f19; min-height: 100vh; padding-top: 6rem;">

    <!-- Ambient glow -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 40% at 50% 0%, rgba(239,68,68,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%); z-index: 0;">
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

      <!-- Page header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full"
          style="border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25); background: rgba(239,68,68,0.05);">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse flex-shrink-0"></span>
          <span style="font-size: 10px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.7);">Classified — Reverse Case Studies</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-black mb-4" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #fff;">
          The Revenue<br/>
          <span style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444 0%, #f87171 50%, #dc2626 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;">Ledger.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="mx-auto mb-6" style="height: 1px; max-width: 200px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(239,68,68,0.4), transparent);"></div>

        <p class="mx-auto" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem); max-width: 38rem; line-height: 1.7;">
          Documented architecture failures from operators spending $9K–$61K per month on paid acquisition — before systemic intervention. All identities redacted. All figures verified.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {dossiers.map((d, i) => (
          <article
            class="reveal flex flex-col rounded-sm overflow-hidden"
            style={`border: 1px solid #1e293b; background: #0d1220; transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease; animation-delay: ${i * 0.07}s;`}
            onmouseenter="this.style.borderColor='rgba(239,68,68,0.25)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-3px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(239,68,68,0.06)'"
            onmouseleave="this.style.borderColor='#1e293b'; this.style.transform=''; this.style.boxShadow=''"
          >

            <!-- Dossier header bar -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3"
              style="background: #0b0f19; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(239,68,68,0.6)" stroke-width="2.5">
                  <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                </svg>
                <span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.6); letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;">Leverage Systems</span>
              </div>
              <span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); letter-spacing: 0.1em;">DOSSIER · {d.serial}</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Redacted identity block -->
            <div class="px-5 py-4" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); margin-bottom: 5px;">Subject Entity</div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <div style="font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 2px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">[REDACTED]</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">· {d.industry}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right flex-shrink-0">
                  <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); margin-bottom: 4px;">Ad Spend</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 13px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">{d.adSpend}</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Leverage Score -->
            <div class="px-5 py-4" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b; background: rgba(239,68,68,0.03);">
              <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5); margin-bottom: 8px;">Overall Leverage Score</div>
              <div class="flex items-end gap-3">
                <span style="font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; color: #ef4444; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; letter-spacing: -0.04em;">{d.score}</span>
                <span style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">/100</span>
                <div class="ml-auto flex-shrink-0 mb-1">
                  <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5); text-align: right; margin-bottom: 3px;">Severity</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 10px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; text-align: right;">
                    {d.score < 20 ? 'CRITICAL' : d.score < 30 ? 'SEVERE' : 'HIGH'}
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Score bar -->
              <div class="mt-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden" style="height: 3px; background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);">
                <div class="h-full rounded-full" style={`width: ${d.score}%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dc2626, #ef4444);`}></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Metrics scorecard -->
            <div class="px-5 py-4" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;">
              <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); margin-bottom: 10px;">Diagnostic Telemetry</div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                {d.metrics.map(m => (
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 rounded-sm"
                    style={`background: ${m.flag ? 'rgba(239,68,68,0.05)' : 'rgba(0,255,65,0.04)'}; border: 1px solid ${m.flag ? 'rgba(239,68,68,0.12)' : 'rgba(0,255,65,0.1)'};`}>
                    <span style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);">{m.label}</span>
                    <span style={`font-size: 10px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 700; color: ${m.flag ? '#ef4444' : '#00FF41'};`}>{m.value}</span>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Technical critique -->
            <div class="px-5 py-5 flex-1">
              <div style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); margin-bottom: 10px;">Technical Execution Critique</div>
              <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.8; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;">{d.critique}</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer bar -->
            <div class="px-5 py-3 flex items-center justify-between"
              style="background: #0b0f19; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;">
              <span style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">Classified · Single-use asset</span>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                <span style="font-size: 9px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5); letter-spacing: 0.1em;">VERIFIED</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom CTA -->
      <div class="mt-20 text-center reveal">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-8" style="height: 1px; max-width: 320px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(239,68,68,0.2), transparent);"></div>
        <p class="mb-2" style="font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">Is your operation in this ledger?</p>
        <h2 class="font-black mb-6" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: #fff; line-height: 1.1;">
          Run your diagnostic.<br/>
          <span style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4AF37 0%, #F5D06B 50%, #C9A227 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;">Find out what's leaking.</span>
        </h2>
        <a href="/#diagnostic" class="neon-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 font-bold rounded-sm"
          style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
          </svg>
          Run My Revenue Audit
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
